{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>BitHero Survivors </strong>is a survivors-like pixel-art action RPG.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from a roster of unique heroes and battle through relentless waves of enemies in fast-paced\u00a0<strong><i>bullet heaven</i></strong> combat!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3842860/extras/28e10a9388a2e8f0517192a507ef7d94.poster.avif?t=1768165774\" aria-hidden=\"true\"width=298 height=298 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3842860/extras/28e10a9388a2e8f0517192a507ef7d94.webm?t=1768165774\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3842860/extras/28e10a9388a2e8f0517192a507ef7d94.mp4?t=1768165774\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features available in the Demo:</strong> </h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2 distinct heroes and 6 starting weapons</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover powerful weapon evolutions -\u00a0hero-exclusive weapons can evolve twice for greater power</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >8 relics to enhance your builds</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face swarms of quirky foes (mushrooms!?)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Open treasure chests to gain bonus experience and power up faster</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Includes the first stage \u2014 replay it endlessly with different heroes, weapons, and strategies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Persistent hero progression \u2014 gain experience, level up, and carry your growth across runs</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Planned for the Full Release:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock an even larger roster of heroes, weapons, and relics</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expanded stages with unique layouts, randomized rewards, and new challenges</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expanded armor system \u2014 collect multiple armor sets across different slots, each with unique stats and synergies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In-game shops and loot progression \u2014 discover, purchase, and upgrade equipment to customize your hero builds</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Additional systems and content to deepen long-term progression</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fight. Survive. Become a true hero!</strong> </p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3842860?t=1768165774","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3842860?t=1768165774","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3842860/c77510c8e7e2292bc7a59bbe175b7330cfcc5f3a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768165774","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3842860/c77510c8e7e2292bc7a59bbe175b7330cfcc5f3a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1768165774","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3971220,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>BitHero Survivors </strong>is a survivors-like pixel-art action RPG.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from a roster of unique heroes and battle through relentless waves of enemies in fast-paced\u00a0<strong><i>bullet heaven</i></strong> combat!</p><p class=\"bb_par