s, each with unique stats and synergies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In-game shops and loot progression \u2014 discover, purchase, and upgrade equipment to customize your hero builds</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Additional systems and content to deepen long-term progression</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fight. Survive. Become a true hero!</strong> </p>","developers":["Nekoza"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3842860/a74ae0f421c79575f7053632e067074b4e9c91c9/header.jpg?t=1768165774","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3842860/903547903/69ddad21e9ce22a85482396ec873b0dac53965ee/1756123116/dash_av1.mpd?t=1756125170","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3842860/903547903/69ddad21e9ce22a85482396ec873b0dac53965ee/1756123116/dash_h264.mpd?t=1756125170","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3842860/903547903/69ddad21e9ce22a85482396ec873b0dac53965ee/1756123116/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1756125170","id":257182862,"name":"BitHero Survivors Demo Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257182862/5ccef33a521e7d18858a4210b3af46d50e2480c5/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1756125170"}],"name":"BitHero Survivors","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_